'''Arm Day Everyday''' (腕自慢, ''Ude Jiman'', '''Bragging Arms''') is a 4-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (M): Cats' health increases by 20%.

